  "description": "Roslyn analyzers and code fixes for Microsoft.Extensions.AI and Microsoft Agent Framework footguns that compile fine and fail silently: UseOpenTelemetry outside UseFunctionInvocation (no tool spans), GetService returning this for every type, middleware that overrides only the buffered or only the streaming path, middleware that mutates the caller's ChatOptions, agents without a stable id in workflow code, and agent middleware that replaces AgentResponse.Messages (lost under OpenTelemetry). No runtime dependency. Not affiliated with Microsoft.",
